Thinly slice @cucumber{1} Place into a #bowl.
Sprinkle with @salt{0.5%tsp}, mix well, and let sit for ~{5%minutes}. Then gently squeeze out excess moisture.
In a separate bowl, mix @rice vinegar{3%tbsp}, @sugar{1.5%tbsp}, and @soy sauce{0.25%tsp} until dissolved.
Combine cucumbers with dressing. Chill if desired.

Garnish with @sesame seeds{1%tsp} before serving. 
Optionally, top with seaweed or crab or shrimp if using.